werful and strong road presence and a ground clearance of 180mm, this <b>crossover vehicle</b> will tackle the urban jungle in style while saving you money with an impressive fuel consumption of <b>5,1 L/100 km</b>.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-47_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-dOorzJ liFmcT pf-48_"><a href="https://pentamotorgroup.co.za/pages/suzuki-ignis-deals" target="_self" data-pf-type="Button" class="sc-emIqIH clWrLz pf-49_ pf-button-1"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dAFaGQ ghivjN pf-51_">View Ignis Deals&nbsp;</span><i class="sc-cKXyOM hKXzjB pf-50_ pf-icon-1 pfaV4 pfaV4-arrow-circle-right" data-pf-type="Icon"></i></a></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-49d4" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-bcSJDS dsCpLi pf-52_ pf-color-scheme-1"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-enkJyZ gKpywE"><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-53_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;--s-lg:0px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-dOorzJ liFmcT pf-54_"><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-gplwNw jZQEok pf-55_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dAFaGQ ghivjN pf-57_">Features</span></h2></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-dOorzJ liFmcT pf-58_"><a href="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0606/0258/1235/files/SUZUKI_NOVEMBER_2021_PRICE_LIST.pdf?v=1637871791" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Button" class="sc-emIqIH clWrLz pf-59_ pf-button-1 pf-lg-hide pf-md-hide pf-sm-hide pf-hide"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dAFaGQ ghivjN pf-61_">Price List</span><i class="sc-cKXyOM hKXzjB pf-60_ pf-icon-1 pfaV4 pfaV4-arrow-circle-down" data-pf-type="Icon"></i></a><a href="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0606/0258/1235/fil